    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Pass a Spy Agency\u2019s Interview?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Agent of Veil</i> is a cozy puzzle adventure filled with secrets, puzzles, puns, and a suspicious number of hidden compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle your way into the covert world of espionage as a potential recruit for the elusive VEIL agency, where you must pass an unconventional spy interview, solve puzzles, answer quirky questions and uncover hidden agency secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/b8b7985f41401e3ef4e7e90186755dd5.webp?t=1754748999\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test with a variety of puzzles, ranging from classic ciphers to unconventional spy interview questions. Gather clues, decode mysterious messages and navigate a world where every solved puzzle brings you closer to the agency\u2019s well-guarded secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/a4a4565b76387579c9e1ec4e70967a4b.poster.avif?t=1754748999\" width=609 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/a4a4565b76387579c9e1ec4e70967a4b.webm?t=1754748999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/ede35f8180d4e483ed7dae9df74f754e.webp?t=1754748999\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your new office is the place where you\u2019ll begin to uncover the agency\u2019s secrets, it is also a place full of intriguing mysteries of its own. Encrypted documents, secret rooms, and coded messages are just the tip of the iceberg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/08e875f0dab24ed2bca44288ba8cba7d.avif?t=1754748999\" width=609 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/4a4715bc8fa0a7f117adefa4d60f4bca.webp?t=1754748999\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll learn about fellow agents and get a taste of the drama that comes with the high-pressure world of espionage. Can you solve encrypted messages while dodging the real problems, like the passive-aggressive notes about the &quot;missing&quot; stapler?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/4489060dae41f93257b6f69fbe61859c.avif?t=1754748999\" width=607 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to step into a world where puzzles are just the beginning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Pass a Spy Agency\u2019s Interview?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Agent of Veil</i> is a cozy puzzle adventure filled with secrets, puzzles, puns, and a suspicious number of hidden compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle your way into the covert world of espionage as a potential recruit for the elusive VEIL agency, where you must pass an unconventional spy interview, solve puzzles, answer quirky questions and uncover hidden agency secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/b8b7985f41401e3ef4e7e90186755dd5.webp?t=1754748999\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test with a variety of puzzles, ranging from classic ciphers to unconventional spy interview questions. Gather clues, decode mysterious messages and navigate a world where every solved puzzle brings you closer to the agency\u2019s well-guarded secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/a4a4565b76387579c9e1ec4e70967a4b.poster.avif?t=1754748999\" width=609 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/a4a4565b76387579c9e1ec4e70967a4b.webm?t=1754748999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/ede35f8180d4e483ed7dae9df74f754e.webp?t=1754748999\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your new office is the place where you\u2019ll begin to uncover the agency\u2019s secrets, it is also a place full of intriguing mysteries of its own. Encrypted documents, secret rooms, and coded messages are just the tip of the iceberg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/08e875f0dab24ed2bca44288ba8cba7d.avif?t=1754748999\" width=609 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/4a4715bc8fa0a7f117adefa4d60f4bca.webp?t=1754748999\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll learn about fellow agents and get a taste of the drama that comes with the high-pressure world of espionage. Can you solve encrypted messages while dodging the real problems, like the passive-aggressive notes about the &quot;missing&quot; stapler?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/4489060dae41f93257b6f69fbe61859c.avif?t=1754748999\" width=607 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to step into a world where puzzles are just the beginning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
